cy unavailable`）”。这表明应用进程本身在运行，但其维护健康的端点因依赖组件故障而主动或被动态地返回 503 错误。\n*   **结论**：Pod 未 Ready 并非由资源瓶颈、崩溃或 K8s 网络层直接导致，而是**应用层内部依赖异常导致健康检查失败**。\n\n*注：具体是哪个上游依赖（如数据库、缓存或内部微服务）导致了 `dependency unavailable`，以及 `/ready` 端点与 `/work` 业务逻辑的代码关联方式，属于当前未确认项，需查阅应用源码或上游组件日志进一步界定。*\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 100.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l: 100.1s (Evidence 89.2s, RCA 10.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 132.963, "metrics": {"run_id": "931e8386d4b44e6c", "mttr": {"value": "2.2m", "seconds": 132.97006678581238, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "51%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源